{"ref":"BDB, רְחוֹב²","hw":"רְחוֹב²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רְחוֹב</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רְחֹב</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.</strong> Πααβ, Ποωβ, etc.:<br><strong>1.</strong>  (cf. Lag<sup>BN 56 f.</sup>) <strong>loc.: </strong> <strong>a.</strong>  towards Hamath, <span dir=\"rtl\">רְחוֹב</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:8\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.8\">2 S 10:8</a> (𝔊L Βαιθρααβ), <span dir=\"rtl\">רְחֹב</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:21\" href=\"/Numbers.13.21\">Nu 13:21</a> (P); = <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית ר׳</span> q.v. p. 112 (also 𝔊 <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:47\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.47\">1 S 14:47</a> Βαιθεωρ, 𝔊L Βαιθροωβι). <strong>b.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">רְחֹב</span> in Asher: (1) <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:28\" href=\"/Joshua.19.28\">Jos 19:28</a> (P); (2) [perhaps = (1)], v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:30\" href=\"/Joshua.19.30\">30</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:31\" href=\"/Judges.1.31\">Ju 1:31</a>, Levit. city <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:31\" href=\"/Joshua.21.31\">Jos 21:31</a> (P) = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:60\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.60\">1 Ch 6:60</a>; Egypt. <em>Raḥubu</em>, N. of Kishon, WMM<sup>As. u. Eur. 153</sup>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong> m.: </strong> <strong>a.</strong>  Aramaic name, <span dir=\"rtl\">רְחֹב</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.3\">2 S 8:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.12\">12</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  post-exilic Levite, <span dir=\"rtl\">רְחוֹב</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:12\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.12\">Ne 10:12</a>.","next":"BDB, רְחֹבוֹת","prev":"BDB, רְחוֹב"}